  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO is providing technical advice/support to the Employers of Kazakhstan as well as the National Confederation of employers for their engagement in labour legislation reforms and modernization of the labour code in line with the present-day trends. The ILO will also support the National Confederation to develop training services for companies to improve the working conditions for their employees in view of the increased number of work-related accidents.</narrative>
  </description>
